    "title": "What stores are open on Easter? Details on Sam's Club, Costco, Walmart",
    "text": "NEWSWhat restaurants are open on Easter Sunday? What about stores? Natassia PalomaEl Paso TimesApril 5, 2026, 6:02 a.m. MTIf your plans involve shopping for last-minute Easter baskets or confetti-filled eggs on Easter Sunday, some stores will be closed.Easter Sunday is April 5, and while some will celebrate by attending mass and participating in Easter egg hunts, you might want to stop by a store or head out to eat after the holiday festivities. Some retail and grocery chains, like Walmart, Whole Foods and Walgreens, are open on the holiday, but others, like Sam's Club, Target and Costco, will be closed.",
